# Balloon Party scripted session. Grammar: tools/smoke.touch and docs/testing.md.
# 1. a quiet start: balloons drift and bob, the hint hand shows up after about 2 s
# 2. slow taps pop balloons (confetti, sparkle, bell notes); three fingers at once
tap   100 0 506 150
tap   128 1 660 232
tap   130 2 265 237
tap   132 3 770 196
# 3. a quick swipe bats whatever it crosses; a slow drag pops what it runs into
drag  160 18 4 60 300 900 260
drag  176 90 5 150 120 460 160
# 4. a tap in empty air, a long hold, a finger drawing a circle
tap   150 6 480 480
hold  200 50 7 700 400
wave  190 80 8 480 250 120 1.2
# 5. ten fingers at once, everywhere, for a while
fuzz  215 100 10
